* ============================================================
                  JAL-RAKSHAK
        Water Monitoring & Alert System
   ============================================================

   HARDWARE (per latest wiring sheet):
   ESP32-WROOM-32
   HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor      (TRIG: GPIO18, ECHO: GPIO19 via voltage divider)
   LM35 Temperature Sensor        (GPIO34, ADC)
   Raindrop Sensor Module         (AO: GPIO35, ADC)
   Vibration Sensor (SW-420)      (DO: GPIO27)
   Buzzer Module                  (IN/S: GPIO25)
   I2C 16x2 LCD                   (SDA: GPIO21, SCL: GPIO22)
   SIM800L GSM Module             (RX2: GPIO16, TX2: GPIO17)
   XL4015 Power Module            (regulated 5V -> ESP32 VIN, ~4.0V -> SIM800L)

   FUNCTIONS:
   1. Read water distance
   2. Calculate water level
   3. Read temperature
   4. Read rain sensor
   5. Read vibration sensor
   6. Calculate water-level rate
   7. Calculate risk score
   8. Display data + alerts on LCD
   9. Sound buzzer alarm on HIGH/CRITICAL risk
   10. Print data on Serial Monitor
   11. Send data to ThingSpeak using Wi-Fi
   12. Send SMS through SIM800L
   13. Serve a live dashboard page on the ESP32's own IP address
*/


